genetics-admin-sequence-description = View or set a gene sequence for the selected donor's DNA.
genetics-admin-unknown-gene = Supply the NetEntity of a filled cartridge or console containing one, followed by RadiantHematopoiesis, RadiantCoagulation or RadiantRegeneration.
genetics-admin-sequence-failed = Use six letters A, T, G, C. Devices working on this DNA must finish their cycles and release any ready cultures.
genetics-admin-sequence-set = Only this donor's sequence changed. Their clues and decoding for this gene were reset across consoles. Other donors, general knowledge and applied modifications are unchanged.
